    "title": "Collage Maker - Photo Editor",
    "description": "<b>Collage Maker</b> is the best photo collage maker and photo editor. You can combine <b>up to 20 photos</b> into photo collage with <b>200+ layouts</b>. You can also edit pictures and make photo collage with <b>filters, texts, stickers, doodles...</b> Then share with friends on Instagram, Facebook, TikTok etc.\r\n\r\nCollage Maker for pictures\r\n\u2764\ufe0f Collage photos with 200+ layouts, grids & frames.\r\n\u2764\ufe0f Photo collage maker for up to 20 photos.\r\n\u2764\ufe0f Photo collage editor with ratio, background, border size, roundness.\r\n\r\nPhoto Editor Pro\r\n\ud83d\udd25 Blur photo like DSLR effect, edit photo like a pro.\r\n\ud83d\udd25 Edit image with <b>filters</b>, <b>texts</b>, <b>stickers</b>, emoji, doodles, crop.\r\n\ud83d\udd25 Post entire photo on Instagram with <b>No Crop</b> Photo Editor.\r\n\r\nFreestyle collage maker\r\n\ud83d\udcf7\u00a0Set background and ratio to create a scrapbook.\r\n\ud83d\udcf7\u00a0A bunch of background to choose from.\r\n\ud83d\udcf7\u00a0Decorate with pictures, stickers, text, doodles to unleash your creative.\r\n\r\nAs a full-featured photo collage maker and photo editor, Collage Maker meets all your needs for pictures, and completely free!",
